						<p class="pDate">Wednesday, September 12, 2001</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Two become One in Holy Matrimony 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						Greetings Norrath!  I would like to announce that my marriage to Kyrelth Stormreaper will take place this Friday, September 14 at 10pm Central in Stonebrunt Mountains near the waterfall.  All are invited to come celebrate this joyous event with us.  Cake will be provided and there will be a drunken brawl that will follow the ceremony.  Gifts accepted, but definitely not required.  :)  /cheer<BR><BR>Deikkena Oakstrider<BR>Druidess of the 40th Season<BR>Jaggedpine Defender
						<br>
						 - Deikkena_Oakstrider<BR><BR>
						</p>
						<p class="sHeader">Comments</p>
						
							<p class="pDate">Wednesday, September 19, 2001</p>
							
							<p class="pTitle">OMG NOOOOO 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I MISSED IT GOD I FEEL STUPID I'm so sorry -- It musta been perfect and beautiful, one to make me have drops in my eyes =)  /congradulate lucky people deserve each other =)
							<br>
							 - Bokkin druid of the 30th "season"<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Waita go!!! 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Waita go!! Gratz!!  I can just imagine it's going to be beautiful and perfect.  /applaud /congradulate
							<br>
							 - Bokkin druid of 30th circle<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Congratulations 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							A belated congrtas to you and your hubby, Deikkena!  I hope the union lasts a long time.<BR><BR>Benevolence Kazama
							<br>
							 - Benevolence<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
